<title>USA: Helen of Troy Ltd Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>Helen of Troy Ltd Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>EL PASO, Texas 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the Three Months Ended  For the Six Months Ended</p>
<p>		     8/31/96	8/31/95     8/31/96     8/31/95</p>
<p> Net sales    $50,491,000 $42,682,000 $94,327,000 $76,226,000</p>
<p> Net earnings   4,095,000   3,357,000   6,497,000   5,039,000</p>
<p>Net earnings   per share (a)	 .30	   .25	   .47	   .38</p>
<p>Weighted average shares outstanding (a)</p>
<p>		   13,801,225  13,426,796  13,709,970  13,402,010</p>
<p>NOTE: (a) Adjusted for a two-for-one stock split paid July 1, 1996, as a 100 percent stock dividend on the company's common stock.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
